{
  "name": "Verify French suppliers before paying invoices with Sirenic and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Verify French suppliers before paying invoices\n\n**Who's it for** — Finance and accounts-payable teams paying French suppliers.\n\n**What it does** — Every new supplier row added to your payment sheet is checked against official French registries in ONE call ($0.03): legal identity, intra-EU VAT verified live against VIES, IBAN structure + bank identification, and a deterministic `pret_a_facturer` (ready-to-invoice) verdict with closed-list reasons.\n\n**How it works** — Sheets row → Sirenic *Verify French Supplier* → IF verdict → log as verified, or alert #purchasing on Slack with the exact reasons (invalid VAT, deregistered company, IBAN inconsistency…).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Install the Sirenic community node (`n8n-nodes-sirenic`) — self-hosted.\n2. Create your Sirenic credentials.\n3. Pick your Google Sheet (columns: `SIREN`, `IBAN` optional) in both Sheets nodes.\n4. Pick your Slack channel.\n\n⚠️ Not a payee verification: the account holder name is never checked. Errors are never billed.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "sticky-main-t01",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-720, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "event": "rowAdded",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "trigger-sheets-t01",
      "name": "New supplier to pay",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-160, 240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "invoicing",
        "operation": "getFrenchPack",
        "siren": "={{ $json.SIREN }}",
        "iban": "={{ $json.IBAN || '' }}"
      },
      "id": "sirenic-verify-t01",
      "name": "Verify supplier before payment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-sirenic.sirenic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [80, 240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-verdict",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.verdict.pret_a_facturer }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-verdict-t01",
      "name": "Ready to invoice?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [320, 240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "SIREN": "={{ $('New supplier to pay').item.json.SIREN }}",
            "Supplier": "={{ $json.destinataire.destinataire.denomination }}",
            "Status": "OK — ready to invoice",
            "VAT (VIES)": "={{ $json.tva_vies ? $json.tva_vies.statut : 'not checked' }}",
            "Checked at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-ok-t01",
      "name": "Log as verified",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [580, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "text": "=:no_entry: *Supplier blocked before payment*\nSIREN {{ $('New supplier to pay').item.json.SIREN }} — {{ $json.destinataire.destinataire.denomination }}\n*Reasons:* {{ ($json.verdict.raisons || []).join(', ') }}\nVAT (VIES): {{ $json.tva_vies ? $json.tva_vies.statut : 'not checked' }} · IBAN: {{ $json.banque ? ($json.banque.valide ? 'structure valid — ' + ($json.banque.banque.identifiee ? $json.banque.banque.nom : 'bank not identified') : 'INVALID') : 'not provided' }}\nSource: {{ $json.source }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "slack-blocked-t01",
      "name": "Alert purchasing on Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [580, 360]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New supplier to pay": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Verify supplier before payment",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Verify supplier before payment": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ready to invoice?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ready to invoice?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log as verified",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Alert purchasing on Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
